#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:1
#: bb266b4761fe4525b54658165f816308
msgid "Isomorphic teleop (`drag_teleop_controller`)"
msgstr "同构遥操作（`drag_teleop_controller`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:3
#: 79f3ce18ed004d85995c9c8bf21314e9
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) for **HighTorque Panthera HT**"
" dual-arm. The ROS package is still named `drag_teleop_controller`; that "
"is **not** drag teaching."
msgstr ""
"面向 **高擎 Panthera HT** 双臂的主从 **同构遥操作**。ROS 软件包仍名为 "
"`drag_teleop_controller`；这 **不是** 拖动示教。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:5
#: 7473025b491e41a2ba90dbbac6494a8d
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/drag_teleop_controller)"
msgstr ""
"**仓库：** [fiveages-sim/drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/drag_teleop_controller)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:7
#: a28e0b47e9b44c3d8b4b2b51af0e8ca9
msgid ""
"**README:** [README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**README：** [README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:9
#: 9e02cd14750f4e3ebfba4dd5fb874120
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:11
#: 688a163fb856446db5de78821947cdc1
msgid "One `ros2_control` controller plugin, started twice:"
msgstr "同一个 `ros2_control` 控制器插件，启动两次："

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:13
#: f9fe4116bf6c460b9a7da3b04f0010ae
msgid ""
"`role:=master` — operator arm with Pinocchio gravity compensation (`τ_G ="
" rnea(q, 0, 0)`); optional force feedback"
msgstr "`role:=master` — 操作者臂，Pinocchio 重力补偿（`τ_G = rnea(q, 0, 0)`）；可选力反馈"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:14
#: 1fdd74c1fbc647a882ac23f1ed34bd6b
msgid ""
"`role:=slave` — follower; tracks mapped master joints (`position` / `mit`"
" / `effort`)"
msgstr "`role:=slave` — 从臂；跟踪映射后的主臂关节（`position` / `mit` / `effort`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:16
#: 9ef2d6b9cfe34276a8b393d6996d7ba5
msgid ""
"Joint mapping (and effort mapping under power conservation) is applied "
"**before** publishing `teleop_states`. Arm joints (12) are commanded by "
"this controller; grippers use `adaptive_gripper_controller`."
msgstr ""
"关节映射（以及功率守恒下的力矩映射）在发布 `teleop_states` **之前**完成。12 个臂关节由本控制器命令；夹爪使用 "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:18
#: 5cb016774d4d41bbbc3de80885c9cc6d
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动文件"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:20
#: f24e91c178434958b5545dd1e45cd877
msgid ""
"Launch file: `drag_teleop_controller.launch.py` (not "
"`drag_teleop.launch.py`)."
msgstr "启动文件：`drag_teleop_controller.launch.py`（不是 `drag_teleop.launch.py`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:22
#: f08efd69fbc2412a935426b44ad98371
msgid ""
"# Mock\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Real (see README for mode × hardware-interface requirements)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"
msgstr ""
"# Mock\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Real (see README for mode × hardware-interface requirements)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"

